  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、おはよう\r\nそれと、気にせずお使いください、だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007030210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい……！　５枚分の写真立てなので……\r\n５日間、レッスン前の時間をお借りする予定です……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900703/2009007030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちゃんと計画も立ててるんだな\r\nどんなのを作るつもりなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007030220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n青い写真立てにしようと思ってます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900703/2009007030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "珍しいな、赤じゃないのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007030230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、海の色にしたくって",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900703/2009007030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007030240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "海はきらきらできれいだし、\r\nビーチグラスもきらきらできれいです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900703/2009007030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007030250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、海に行けない時でも\r\n海にいる感じがすると思うんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900703/2009007030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど\r\n順調そうならいいんだ",
